    "The construction of geometric realizations for the prescribed eigenvalues, including the holomorphic Lefschetz input, the choice of auxiliary level, and the local Frobenius, crystalline and Hodge comparisons on these realizations, remains upstream.",
    "REX-01 through REX-14 prove the extraction theorem under its local jump, semisimplicity and annihilator hypotheses. The construction of the global determinant character remains upstream.",
    "The integral Hecke frame, genericity density and finite-dimensional conjugate-form argument are reconstructed. The local cuspidal type is constructed in the chapter. The varying-weight automorphic family, its decomposition and its uniform estimates still enter upstream. Fixed-weight crystalline closure and local Weil moment closure enter the subsequent limit independently."
  ]
